{"path":"types/type_index/hash","title":"std::hash<std::type_index>","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>hash<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">&lt;std::type_index&gt;</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/types/type_index/hash","section":"types","kind":"page","summary":"The template specialization of std::hash for std::type_index allows users to obtain hashes of objects of type std::type_index.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/typeindex\">&lt;typeindex&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&gt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> hash<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/type_index\"><span class=\"kw454\">std::<span class=\"me2\">type_index</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>The template specialization of <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/hash\">std::hash</a></span> for <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/type_index\">std::type_index</a></span> allows users to obtain hashes of objects of type <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/type_index\">std::type_index</a></span>.\n</p><p>The member <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">operator<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> effectively returns the same value as <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/type_index/hash_code\">hash_code()</a></span>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-me